e finite dimension.     </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"</p>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\">II and III only</div></div>",
